  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Cut pumpkin into 1 cm-thick wedges.\n• Place pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt, sprinkle with paprika spice blend and toss to coat. Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• TIP: Peel the pumpkin if you prefer and scrape out the seeds, if necessary!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68395936f7d5496ac4a6f3d6/step-90c4e800.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, halve Brussels sprouts.\n• Place Brussels sprouts on a second lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat.\n• Arrange cut-side down and roast until tender, 15-18 minutes.\n• TIP: The Brussels sprouts will char slightly, this adds to the flavour!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68395936f7d5496ac4a6f3d6/step-7b220b10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While sprouts are roasting, in a medium saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Toast pearl couscous, stirring occasionally, until golden, 1-2 minutes.\n• Carefully half-fill the saucepan with water, then add a pinch of salt. Simmer, uncovered, until tender, 14-16 minutes.\n• Drain, rinse and return to the pan with stock concentrate and a drizzle of olive oil. Stir until well combined.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68395936f7d5496ac4a6f3d6/step-9acdfe20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While couscous is cooking, slice lemon into wedges. Pick mint leaves.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68395936f7d5496ac4a6f3d6/step-d476b830.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Once veggies are done, to the pearl couscous, add harissa paste, spinach & rocket mix, roasted Brussels sprouts and a good squeeze of lemon juice.\n• Toss to combine and season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68395936f7d5496ac4a6f3d6/step-b4408c40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide harissa pearl couscous toss between bowls. Top with pumpkin.\n• Dollop with babaganoush.\n• Garnish with mint leaves and crumble over marinated goat cheese.\n• Serve with any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68395936f7d5496ac4a6f3d6/step-0bc75250.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
